    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.poster.avif?t=1754465117\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.webm?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.mp4?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>TWIN FLAMES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a captivating journey in <strong>TWIN FLAMES</strong>, a turn-based co-op puzzle adventure inspired by Indian mythology. Guide soulmates Savitri and Satyavan through a vibrant low-poly world, navigating hex-grid challenges to unite their-destinies. Play solo or team up in local co-op to solve intricate puzzles, blending strategy and a heartfelt love story. Will their 27th attempt finally forge an unbreakable bond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.poster.avif?t=1754465117\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.webm?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.mp4?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twin Flame Journey</strong>: Experience a romantic tale of two souls striving for unity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op Mode</strong>: Collaborate with a friend to test your synergy and deepen the connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Low Poly Art</strong>: Explore breathtaking, colorful landscapes in a minimalist style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Hex-Grid Puzzles</strong>: Master turn-based challenges that test logic and teamwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Mythology</strong>: Immerse yourself in a narrative rooted in timeless Indian folklore. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.poster.avif?t=1754465117\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.webm?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.mp4?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Join Savitri and Satyavan on their quest to become Twin Flames. Explore, strategize, and connect in this captivating puzzle adventure.</strong></u></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.poster.avif?t=1754465117\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.webm?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/0ae42986b19ff6cad836f73b04f0fd77.mp4?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>TWIN FLAMES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a captivating journey in <strong>TWIN FLAMES</strong>, a turn-based co-op puzzle adventure inspired by Indian mythology. Guide soulmates Savitri and Satyavan through a vibrant low-poly world, navigating hex-grid challenges to unite their-destinies. Play solo or team up in local co-op to solve intricate puzzles, blending strategy and a heartfelt love story. Will their 27th attempt finally forge an unbreakable bond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.poster.avif?t=1754465117\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.webm?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/2fc1be9106835b7effe3e7a7f6368fcd.mp4?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twin Flame Journey</strong>: Experience a romantic tale of two souls striving for unity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op Mode</strong>: Collaborate with a friend to test your synergy and deepen the connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Low Poly Art</strong>: Explore breathtaking, colorful landscapes in a minimalist style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Hex-Grid Puzzles</strong>: Master turn-based challenges that test logic and teamwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Mythology</strong>: Immerse yourself in a narrative rooted in timeless Indian folklore. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.poster.avif?t=1754465117\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.webm?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/02123f1dcd23edd7db4d707dd644df0a.mp4?t=1754465117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Join Savitri and Satyavan on their quest to become Twin Flames. Explore, strategize, and connect in this captivating puzzle adventure.</strong></u></h2>",
